# Agent Company

Multi-agent Slack Living Company. Bun + TypeScript + SQLite. Five bots in one process.

## Before editing

Read `CLAUDE.md` for full handoff (Slack app IDs, known bugs, env vars).

## Current config (do not assume README defaults)

- Branch: `cursor/living-company-multi-provider`
- Architect → `openrouter` / `openrouter/free` (not Gemini)
- Budget: `dailyRealCallLimit: 200` in `config/agents.yaml`
- Coordination: `cooldownMs: 400`, `responseDelayMs: 0`, `maxConsecutiveAgentTurns: 5`
- `.env` uses `dotenv.config({ override: true })` in `src/config/env.ts`

## Key paths

- `config/agents.yaml` — agents, providers, budget
- `src/slack/slackTools.ts` — channel ID resolve, join, activeChannelId
- `src/coordinator/conversationCoordinator.ts` — loop guards
- `src/living/` — task queue, heartbeat, autonomous loop

## Never

- Commit `.env` or secrets
- Expose tokens in chat
- Assume Slack @handles match display names (legacy @ceo etc.)
